        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋiketeok ŋipukei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epite ŋolo atyakatyakatere ŋiketeok ŋipukei lo: Alemunitae aneni a Ŋikorasi Meselemia lokoku a Kore ŋolo anateker ka Asap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lu ŋidwe a Meselemia ŋulusapa: Sakariya iŋes ŋolokiyae, Yediael ŋolo a ŋiarei, Sebadia iŋes ŋolo a ŋiuni, ŋolo a ŋiomwon iŋes Yasiniel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo a ŋikan iŋes Elam, ŋolo a ŋikanikapei iŋes Yeoanan ka ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei iŋes Elieonai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lu ŋidwe ka Obededom ŋulusapa: Ŋolokiyae iŋes Semaia, ŋolo a ŋiarei iŋes Yeosabad, ŋolo a ŋiuni iŋes Yoa, ŋolo a ŋiomwon iŋes Sakar, ŋolo a ŋikan iŋes Nesanel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo a ŋikanikapei iŋes Amiel, ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei iŋes Isakar ka ŋolo a ŋikanikauni iŋes Peulesai. Etiyakin ŋun anerae abu Akuj kiterereŋ Obededom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar Semaia daŋ lokoku ka Obededom ŋidwe ŋulusapa, ŋulu arae ŋikarikok a ŋituŋa kec, anerae ayenete ikes arikit ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋidwe ŋul ikes lu: Oseni, Repael, Obed ka Elisabad, arae lu ŋiyeneta a Semaia: Eliu ka Semakia, arae ikes daŋ ŋikarikok ŋulu ayenete arikit ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋiletok ka Obededom; ayenete ikes ka ŋidwe kec ta ŋiyeneta kec arikit ŋituŋa, ido agogoŋ daŋ alotooma etic. Arae ikes daadaŋ ŋatomonikanikapei ka ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar Meselemia ŋidwe ŋulusapa ka ŋiyeneta ŋulu ayenete arikit ŋituŋa. Arae ikes daadaŋ ŋitomon ka ŋikanikauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lu ŋidwe ka Osa a ŋolo arae Emerarit: Simiri iŋes arae ekarikon (tari daŋ ŋina pa araakar iŋes ekiyae, abu papa keŋ toseu iŋes aruwor ekarikon), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo a ŋiarei iŋes Ilikia, ŋolo a ŋiuni iŋes Tebalia ka ŋolo a ŋiomwon iŋes Sakariya. Arae ŋidwe ka Osa ŋulusapa ka ŋiyeneta keŋ daadaŋ ŋitomon ka ŋiuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyakatyakatae ŋiketeok ka Akai ka Akuj ŋul a ŋatukon, a ŋikalya, ido ainakinitae ŋiticisyo alo Kai ka Akuj lopite ŋolo kitiyaata ŋiyeneta kec ekiŋaren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi kisitiyae akilamilam aseunia ŋiketeok a ŋolopuke, eryaaritae a ŋikalya, eseo pa etyakatyakatae ŋisorok ka ŋikasikou. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi anakilamilamet a ŋina esyaunan toseunae Selemia akitere epuke ka Akai ka Akuj ŋolo alo Kide. Ekaku, aponi kilamilamae aŋuna a Sakariya alokoku keŋ, a ŋolo arae ekile ŋolo aoson ŋolo ayeni alimokin ituŋanan ŋakiro ŋuna ajokak, ido abu akilamilamet toseu iŋes akitere epuke ka Akai ka Akuj ŋolo alo Kuju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu akilamilamet ŋina ke epuke a ŋolo alo Kwap Akai ka Akuj toseu Obededom aruwor eketen epuke ŋol, ido abu akilamilamet ŋina ka akitere agule ŋina eŋadao ŋiboro, toseu ŋidwe ka Obededom ŋulusapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋakilamilameta ŋuna ke epuke a ŋolo alo To ka ŋuna ke epuke a ŋolo a Salekes a ŋolo ayai lorot ŋolo etorit nenimukur, toseut Supim ka Osa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowae ŋolo alo Kide Akai ka Akuj, ayakasi a ŋinakoloŋit ŋilepi ŋikanikapei, lowae ŋolo alo Kuju Akai ŋin, ayakasi a ŋinakoloŋit ŋilepi ŋiomwon, lowae ŋolo alo Kwap Akai ŋin ayakasi a ŋinakoloŋit ŋilepi ŋiomwon, ido a ŋinakoloŋit ayakasi ŋiketeok ŋiomwon akitere agule ŋina eŋadao ŋiboro, ŋiarei a ŋinagule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi ŋiketeok ŋiomwon lowae ŋolo alo To, eboiyete alorukude ka ŋiarei eboiyete alobarasan ka Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋol epite ŋolo atyakatyakatere Ŋikorasi ka ŋidwe a Merari ŋulusapa ŋulu eteete ŋipukei ka Akai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikeŋadak ŋisiliŋa, ŋikapolok ka ŋikatubok ŋakiro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alo Lepi a ŋuluce, ainakinitae Aija apolokin ŋisiliŋa ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj ka ŋagulei ŋuna eŋadao ŋainakineta ŋuna einakinitae neni ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladan epei a ŋidwe a Gerisom a ŋulusapa, iŋes arae papaa a ŋikalya a ŋulu alalak kaapei ke ekal alokoku keŋ Yeiel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainakinitae ŋidwe a Yeiel ŋulusapa lu: Sesam ka Yoel akidarit ŋisiliŋa ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainakinitae daŋ ŋiticisyo neni a ŋipapae a Ŋiamirami, a Ŋiisari, a Ŋieburoni ka a Ŋiusieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebuel ŋolo anateker a Moses, lokoku a Gerisom iŋes apolokinit ŋisiliŋa ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayenasi Selomis ka Gerisom aneni alokaato keŋ Elieser. Arae Elieser papa a Reabia, a ŋolo arae papa a Yesia, a ŋolo arae papa a Yoram, a ŋolo arae papa a Siciri, a ŋolo arae papa Selomis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainakinitae Selomis ka ŋituŋa ke ekal keŋ akidarit ŋainakineta daadaŋ ŋuna einakinit erwosit Daudi neni ka Akuj ŋuna einakinito ŋikarikok a ŋikalya neni ka Akuj ka ŋuna einakinito ŋikarikok a ŋatekerin neni ka Akuj ta ŋuna einakinito ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya neni ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋul yaasi ŋiboro ŋice ŋulu aŋatunete ikes alojiesyo Kai ka Akuj, ikotere kisitiyae asubanakinia Akai ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi inakinae Selomis ka ŋiyeneta keŋ akidar ŋiboro daadaŋ alo Kai ka Akuj ŋulu ainakini Samuel eketeyenikinan ŋakiro, ŋulu ainakini Saul lokoku a Kis, ŋulu ainakini Abiner lokoku a Ner ka ŋulu ainakini Yoab lokoku a Seruia ta ŋiboro ŋice daadaŋ ŋulu ainakinitae Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
